<% content_for :title, "Features" %>
<% content_for :page_heading, "Features" %>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-8 ptfgPageWidth">
    <div class="hmHero">
      <span class="hmHero-eyebrow">Private Leagues</span>
      <h1 class="hmHero-title">Be the Commissioner of Your Own Private League</h1>
      <p class="hmHero-lead">
        A private league gives you the opportunity to be the commissioner of your own league, where you set the
        entry fee, determine prizes, choose the tournament schedule, and more. Our leagues consistently earn
        outstanding feedback.
      </p>
      <p class="hmHero-lead">
        As commissioner, you're in charge of creating each team, collecting entry fees, and distributing prizes.
        Beyond that, we handle the rest — including adjusting lineup deadlines due to weather and calculating
        weekly results and standings.
      </p>
      <p class="hmHero-lead">
        You can select from one to four <b><%= link_to "formats", game_formats_path %></b> and define
        the start and end tournaments for your league season. While some leagues cover the entire PGA Tour, most
        stick to 18–33 tournaments, including all four majors, offering flexibility to match your desired level of
        commitment. Some leagues kick off in January, others with The Masters in April, and some fall somewhere in
        between. You can also choose how many segments you'd like for your season.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ftStats">
      <div class="ftStat">
        <i class="bi bi-controller ftStat-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="ftStat-value">1 &ndash; 4</span>
        <span class="ftStat-label">game formats to choose from</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ftStat">
        <i class="bi bi-flag ftStat-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="ftStat-value">18 &ndash; 33</span>
        <span class="ftStat-label">tournaments, including all four majors</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ftStat">
        <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge ftStat-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="ftStat-value">3 &ndash; 4 hrs</span>
        <span class="ftStat-label">to final results after the round ends</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ftStat">
        <i class="bi bi-telephone ftStat-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="ftStat-value">15 &ndash; 20 min</span>
        <span class="ftStat-label">commissioner training call included</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hmFeatures">
      <div class="hmFeatureGroup hmFeatureGroup--blue ftGroup">
        <h4 class="hmFeatureGroup-title ftGroup-title">
          <i class="bi bi-person-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>As Commissioner, You'll Have the Ability To
        </h4>
        <div class="hmFeatureGrid ftGrid">
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-trophy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>
              Customize prize structures for the season, segments, weekly winners, skins games, majors, and
              one &amp; done streaks.
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>Keep track of who has paid their league entry fee.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-people" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>
              Set up teams each season or let participants self sign-up (recommended). From season 2 on, you
              can pre-load last year's teams to speed up setup.
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>
              Make lineup changes on behalf of participants at any time &mdash; perfect for those who miss the deadline
              or can&rsquo;t get online, especially if you're a generous Commish.
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>
              Email all league participants directly from the league website, or create your own email distribution list.
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-megaphone" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>Post important announcements on the league website.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hmFeatureGroup hmFeatureGroup--green ftGroup">
        <h4 class="hmFeatureGroup-title ftGroup-title">
          <i class="bi bi-people" aria-hidden="true"></i>All Participants Will Have Access To
        </h4>
        <div class="hmFeatureGrid ftGrid">
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-globe2" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>Selecting their time zone so lineup deadlines automatically display in their local time.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>Choosing whether to receive weekly lineup reminders and missing lineup notifications via email.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hmFeatureItem ftItem">
            <span class="hmFeatureItem-icon ftItem-icon"><i class="bi bi-envelope-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>Receiving confirmation emails once a lineup is submitted.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gfGrid ftInfoGrid" style="margin-top: 6px">
      <div class="gfCard gfCard--blue">
        <div class="gfCard-top"></div>
        <div class="gfCard-header">
          <span class="gfCard-number"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <h4 class="gfCard-title">Fast, Automated Post-Round Scoring</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gfCard-body">
          <p class="gfCard-paragraph">
            Projected earnings for each golfer, based on their current tournament position, are updated after each
            round (Thursday through Saturday). Final results, including updated league standings, are posted every
            Sunday night — typically within 3–4 hours of round completion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gfCard gfCard--green">
        <div class="gfCard-top"></div>
        <div class="gfCard-header">
          <span class="gfCard-number"><i class="bi bi-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <h4 class="gfCard-title">Automated Reminders</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gfCard-body">
          <p class="gfCard-paragraph">
            The system automatically sends weekly lineup reminder emails every Wednesday morning. If a participant
            hasn&rsquo;t submitted a lineup, a subsequent missing lineup email goes out early Thursday morning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gfCard gfCard--purple">
        <div class="gfCard-top"></div>
        <div class="gfCard-header">
          <span class="gfCard-number"><i class="bi bi-trophy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <h4 class="gfCard-title">History, Trophies &amp; Clubhouse</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gfCard-body">
          <p class="gfCard-paragraph">
            To celebrate success, virtual trophies (icons) are displayed on the standings page for league winners.
            Historical data is preserved for every season and includes a Hall of Fame and career prize earnings
            page. There&rsquo;s even a Clubhouse page where league members can chat and talk a little friendly
            smack.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hmCallout ftCta">
      <h4 class="hmCallout-title"><i class="bi bi-flag-fill ftCta-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>Ready to Get Started?</h4>
      <p class="hmCallout-text">
        We also include a 15–20 minute commissioner training call with your entry fee to help you get up to speed.
        The league setup fee is <b><%= MIN_LEAGUE_FEE %></b>, due before we get things rolling. The remaining
        balance is payable after the season begins and team totals are confirmed.
      </p>
      <p class="hmCallout-text">
        If you've been managing your fantasy golf league through spreadsheets and email, just imagine how much
        time this will save you. So&hellip; what are you waiting for?
      </p>
      <div class="ftCta-buttons">
        <%= link_to "New League Request", order_now_path, class: "hmBtn hmBtn--primary" %>
        <%= link_to "Not Sure Yet? Contact Us", contact_us_path, class: "hmBtn hmBtn--outline" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <%= render "layouts/right_logo" %>
</div>
